{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/1.png?t=1634886067\" /><br><br><strong>Tense Reflection</strong> is an innovative puzzle / shooter where you need to solve puzzles in order to reload your ammo / change the color of your shots.<br><br>In order to win, you must quickly switch between <strong>3 panels</strong>\u00a0:<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/ColorPanel.png?t=1634886067\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/PuzzlePanel.png?t=1634886067\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/ShootingPanel.png?t=1634886067\" /><br>In Tense Reflection, you will never be able to slow down. Keep going, stay focus, and good luck.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/colorblind.png?t=1634886067\" /><br><br>The game features a colorblind mode.<br><br>Tense Reflection features musics from the 7 following artists\u00a0:<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/artists.png?t=1634886067\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/extras/crack.png?t=1634886067\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/655670?t=1634886067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/655670?t=1634886067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1634886067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/655670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1634886067","categories":[{"descriptio